  ~ no callers in scanned roots

%decision RefundQuantityIsNotNegated
  what:    SaleQuantity and RefundQuantity both require a count of zero or more; only refund money is negative
  why:     The backend writes a refund line's quantity as the number of units returned. Its toRefundQuantity does not negate. The front end used to require zero or less, so a refund with lines did not decode. toRefundQuantity and toSaleQuantity keep the count as it is.
