%decision ItemFormOnUIForm
  what:    menuItemForm is one applicative Form MenuItem built from four section sub-forms; itemForm runs it and owns only the status message and submitting flag
  why:     Replaced a 650-line version with two useHot cells per field and about twelve touch points per field. CreateMode carries the SKU and an onCreated callback; EditMode carries the item.
  affects: menuItemForm, itemForm

%open_issue StrictNameRuleBlocksExistingItems
  what:     Name, brand, subcategory, strain, creator and dominant terpene use required >=> alphanumeric; edit mode parses the stored value, so an existing item with an apostrophe, period or ampersand shows a hint and cannot be saved until changed
  why:      Owner's decision 2026-10-04: keep the strict rule for now. extendedAlphanumeric >=> maxLen 50 is the one-line alternative in requiredName.
  affects:  menuItemForm


