%mod UI.Leave

%uses Prelude
%uses Effect

type OnLeave = Effect Unit -> Effect Unit

%decision PagesRegisterCleanupWithOnLeave
  what:    OnLeave is a function a page calls with a close action; Main runs every registered action before the next render, including on sign-out
  why:     This version of Deku has no unmount hook, so a page cannot close its own stream when it is replaced. Used by Pages.Stock.Interface, Pages.Admin.Tabs.LogViewer and Pages.Admin.Tabs.FeedMonitor. The module holds only the type alias OnLeave = Effect Unit -> Effect Unit and no functions.
  affects: 


